(197,'Tailoring','Save cloth from normal quests; buy thread in town. Coordinate Elixir of Wisdom with an alchemist.','Cloth gear and bags; compare complete weapon/off-hand sets separately.',[(1,55,'1-30 Linen Bolts; 30-55 Linen Belt. Retain bolts for crafting.'),(55,125,'55-80 Wool Bolts; 80-95 Woolen Cape; 95-100 Double-stitched Woolen Shoulders; 100-120 Silk Bolts; 120-125 Gloves of Meditation using Elixir of Wisdom.'),(125,225,'Check Expert training; retain silk and later mageweave. Compare useful cloth pieces against quest rewards. Exact remaining recipe steps incomplete.'),(225,300,'Save runecloth and check Artisan/pattern access before long farms. Later exact route incomplete and untested here.')]),
(186,'Mining','Carry a pick and enable Find Minerals; smelt during town visits.','Supply Blacksmithing/Engineering or sell excess after reserving useful crafts.',[(1,75,'Smelt Copper toward 65. At 65 train tin/bronze; smelt tin toward 75. Gather on nearby quest routes.'),(75,150,'Bronze smelting can reach roughly 105; use nearby eligible ore thereafter. Check node requirements before changing zones.'),(150,225,'Gather eligible iron/mithril during quests. Train before the cap; avoid dangerous detours solely for skill.'),(225,300,'Plan later thorium routes with level-appropriate quests. Node access and exact zone routes remain incomplete.')]),
(129,'First Aid','Reserve some cloth for bandages rather than spending all of it on Tailoring.','Bandages reduce recovery downtime; Forever healing potions also use this skill.',[(1,75,'1-40 Linen Bandage; 40-75 Heavy Linen Bandage. Potion alternative uses herbs, spices and vials.'),(75,150,'75-80 Heavy Linen; 80-115 Wool Bandage; 115-150 Heavy Wool Bandage. Train Journeyman before the cap.'),(150,225,'At skill 125 obtain Expert First Aid - Under Wraps: Deneb Walker (Alliance, Arathi) or Balai Lok\'Wein (Horde, Dustwallow). Buy the follow-up manuals too.'),(225,300,'Check Artisan quest and later manual requirements before travel. Exact late bandage/potion route incomplete.')]),
